WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.980
The Rose of Versailles

00:00:14.260 --> 00:00:16.590
<i>The city of Paris was lively once again.</i>

00:00:18.030 --> 00:00:20.250
<i>The flag of the Kingdom of
France fluttered in the air,</i>

00:00:20.250 --> 00:00:25.140
<i>and the portrait of Louis XVI and his
Queen decorated the shop windows.</i>

00:00:25.140 --> 00:00:28.000
<i>The people walked with a lightness to their steps.</i>

00:00:29.180 --> 00:00:30.850
<i>In the adorned streets,</i>

00:00:30.850 --> 00:00:33.970
<i>the joyful voices of the people cheering
in the new era could be heard.</i>

00:00:35.280 --> 00:00:40.520
<i>The people had placed tremendous
hope in the new King's reign.</i>

00:00:45.230 --> 00:00:46.560
Your Majesty.

00:00:46.560 --> 00:00:48.900
This man before you is only a Baron,

00:00:48.900 --> 00:00:52.030
but he has requested the
post of Secretary of the Court.

00:00:53.170 --> 00:00:57.570
He humbly asks to receive Your Majesty's
recommendation, if possible...

00:00:58.490 --> 00:01:00.010
I understand.

00:01:00.010 --> 00:01:01.240
Do not worry.

00:01:01.240 --> 00:01:04.640
His Majesty will listen to any request I make.

00:01:05.280 --> 00:01:06.580
Lady Antoinette!

00:01:07.620 --> 00:01:10.520
Accepting his request without
examining his character...

00:01:10.520 --> 00:01:13.210
...and looking into his past credentials is rather...

00:01:14.390 --> 00:01:17.390
Count Mercy, you're always worried
about something, aren't you?

00:01:17.390 --> 00:01:18.460
Don't worry.

00:01:18.460 --> 00:01:20.220
I'm no longer a child.

00:01:20.830 --> 00:01:22.930
I am Queen of France now.

00:01:23.330 --> 00:01:25.020
I won't take orders from anyone.

00:01:25.900 --> 00:01:28.940
Grand Chamberlain, that will
be all for today's audience.

00:01:28.940 --> 00:01:32.270
Well then, let us finish
that play, Countess Noailles.

00:01:34.210 --> 00:01:35.640
Lady Antoinette!

00:01:34.480 --> 00:01:35.640
Lady Antoinette!

00:01:37.210 --> 00:01:38.610
<i>Wonderful!</i>

00:01:38.610 --> 00:01:40.340
<i>This is all so wonderful!</i>

00:01:41.020 --> 00:01:44.390
<i>I can assign whomever I want as minister!</i>

00:01:44.390 --> 00:01:46.660
<i>No one can tell me what I can or cannot do!</i>

00:01:46.660 --> 00:01:49.280
<i>Yes, I am the Queen of France!</i>

00:01:49.860 --> 00:01:52.330
<i>From now on, I can dance the
night away at the masquerade ball,</i>

00:01:52.330 --> 00:01:55.200
<i>go see the opera, buy jewelry...</i>

00:01:55.200 --> 00:01:58.830
<i>Anything...! I'm free to do it all!</i>

00:01:58.830 --> 00:01:59.560
<i>Free...!</i>

00:02:00.240 --> 00:02:01.700
<i>I'm free!</i>

