00:03:33.610 --> 00:03:39.030
episode

00:03:33.610 --> 00:03:39.030
"Fersen Leaves for
\h     the Northern Lands"

00:04:12.920 --> 00:04:14.610
You've gotten a lot better, André.

00:04:15.250 --> 00:04:17.190
It's becoming frightening to use real swords with you.

00:04:18.090 --> 00:04:19.960
I'm still no match for you.

00:04:19.960 --> 00:04:23.490
No matter what I do, your agility
always gets the better of me.

00:04:24.300 --> 00:04:25.240
Oscar!

00:04:25.840 --> 00:04:27.200
What is it, Father?

00:04:27.200 --> 00:04:29.100
Rejoice, Oscar!

00:04:29.100 --> 00:04:31.740
You have been promoted to Regiment
Commander of the Royal Guards!

00:04:31.740 --> 00:04:33.900
Your rank has jumped to Colonel!

00:04:34.570 --> 00:04:35.670
Regiment Commander?!

00:04:35.670 --> 00:04:37.420
I was told...

00:04:37.420 --> 00:04:42.380
...Lady Antoinette's first request to His Majesty,
after becoming Queen, was your promotion!

00:04:43.720 --> 00:04:45.050
Lady Antoinette has...?!

00:04:50.950 --> 00:04:53.140
From now on, as Regiment Commander
of the Royal Guards,

00:04:53.140 --> 00:04:56.650
please be at my side even
more so than before, Oscar.

00:04:56.960 --> 00:04:57.620
Certainly.

00:04:58.400 --> 00:05:02.110
I have arranged for your pension
and salary to be doubled, as well.

00:05:03.970 --> 00:05:05.540
Thank you for your gracious words.

00:05:05.540 --> 00:05:07.950
The honor is more than I deserve.

00:05:09.470 --> 00:05:10.740
However, Your Majesty...

00:05:12.380 --> 00:05:17.220
Currently, France's finances
can hardly be seen as affluent.

00:05:17.220 --> 00:05:19.500
I ask that you to keep my salary the same.

00:05:22.020 --> 00:05:25.340
Otherwise, I cannot accept this promotion.

00:05:26.020 --> 00:05:26.880
Oscar...

00:05:37.300 --> 00:05:39.070
Very well, Oscar.

00:05:40.570 --> 00:05:44.320
But if there's anything you wish, do ask me.

00:05:44.730 --> 00:05:47.550
A higher rank, horses, castles, anything...

00:05:47.550 --> 00:05:50.850
I am now in a position that can
grant any wish you may have!

00:05:50.850 --> 00:05:52.200
Lady Antoinette!

00:05:53.050 --> 00:05:59.170
My only wish is to see you become
a splendid Queen, Lady Antoinette.

00:06:14.970 --> 00:06:16.910
Is our Lady ready yet?

00:06:16.910 --> 00:06:18.540
Don't be so anxious.

00:06:18.540 --> 00:06:21.080
It takes time for a woman to get ready.

00:06:21.080 --> 00:06:24.070
Don't be silly. You know you want to see her, too!

00:06:36.830 --> 00:06:40.230
My, you look even more dashing!

00:06:40.230 --> 00:06:43.170
The uniform of the Regiment
Commander suits you so well!

00:06:43.170 --> 00:06:45.800
Even a woman like me would
fall in love with you!

00:06:46.400 --> 00:06:50.880
You falling in love with Oscar would
mean nothing but trouble, Grandma.

00:06:50.880 --> 00:06:54.110
Hey! Listen to you, making fun
of your grandmother again!

00:06:54.110 --> 00:06:55.310
Sorry, sorry.

00:06:55.310 --> 00:06:56.250
The truth just slipped.

00:06:56.250 --> 00:06:57.620
That's even worse!

00:06:57.220 --> 00:06:58.010
Yikes...!

00:07:02.790 --> 00:07:04.110
Lady Oscar.

00:07:04.110 --> 00:07:08.860
A great number of gifts have been delivered from the Palace, congratulating you on this occasion.

00:07:09.290 --> 00:07:13.740
Please politely convey that while I appreciate
the gesture, I cannot accept them.

00:07:15.000 --> 00:07:16.160
Certainly.

00:07:17.740 --> 00:07:20.240
Lady Oscar, how wasteful of you!

00:07:20.240 --> 00:07:23.770
How could you decline the
gifts from Lady Antoinette?!

00:07:24.540 --> 00:07:28.250
Nanna, doing so is better
for Lady Antoinette's sake.

00:07:28.250 --> 00:07:28.840
But...

00:07:33.420 --> 00:07:36.990
She's too true to her emotions...

00:07:36.990 --> 00:07:41.220
...and openly displays her
devotion to those she favors.

00:07:46.760 --> 00:07:47.560
However...

00:07:48.370 --> 00:07:52.360
However, all the money Lady Antoinette spends,
comes directly from the people's taxes.

00:07:52.900 --> 00:07:56.120
Her sincerity frightens me.

00:07:57.440 --> 00:08:01.790
I'm worried how the people might
begin to regard Lady Antoinette.

00:08:02.350 --> 00:08:03.210
That's nonsense.

00:08:03.210 --> 00:08:04.920
You're worried over nothing.

00:08:04.920 --> 00:08:08.000
The people are all enamored with Lady Antoinette.

00:08:08.890 --> 00:08:10.650
I sure hope so...

00:08:21.570 --> 00:08:24.840
I see. Oscar declined my gifts...

00:08:24.840 --> 00:08:26.810
Yes, I'm sorry.

00:08:27.610 --> 00:08:31.340
<i>Why isn't Oscar pleased with my gifts?</i>

00:08:46.220 --> 00:08:50.660
<i>Fersen hasn't visited me either,
since I became Queen...</i>

00:08:51.830 --> 00:08:52.720
Madame Noailles.

00:08:52.720 --> 00:08:54.100
Yes?

00:08:54.100 --> 00:08:56.590
That Swedish Count, Fersen,

00:08:56.590 --> 00:08:58.720
hasn't visited Versailles lately, has he?

00:08:59.240 --> 00:09:04.110
He came here for his studies, so he
may be busy with other things.

00:09:04.510 --> 00:09:05.640
I see...

00:09:05.640 --> 00:09:06.730
I'm sure he is.

00:09:07.250 --> 00:09:11.250
Lady Antoinette, the general audience
is about to begin in the Hall of Mirrors.

00:09:11.250 --> 00:09:12.440
Please proceed to the hall.

00:09:17.600 --> 00:09:18.860
Grand Chamberlain,

00:09:18.860 --> 00:09:22.750
I'm feeling unwell today,
so please cancel the audience.

00:09:23.290 --> 00:09:26.040
Wh-What are you saying, Lady Antoinette?!

00:09:27.000 --> 00:09:28.500
He's right, Princess.

00:09:28.500 --> 00:09:32.700
You are no longer the Dauphine,
but the Queen of France.

00:09:32.700 --> 00:09:35.070
Being fickle and selfish is not allowed!

00:09:35.070 --> 00:09:37.430
Meeting your subjects is your duty as Queen.

00:09:37.810 --> 00:09:45.140
Not only that, these people have come to
congratulate the new King and Queen.

00:09:45.750 --> 00:09:46.840
Very well.

00:09:47.490 --> 00:09:49.690
Then, I will see no more than 10 people.

00:09:49.690 --> 00:09:51.360
No more than 10?!

00:09:51.360 --> 00:09:52.290
That's all?!

00:09:52.860 --> 00:09:57.030
But several hundred people have
come to give their well wishes!

00:09:58.400 --> 00:09:59.330
Your Majesty.

00:09:59.730 --> 00:10:01.790
There is a request for a special audience.

00:10:02.330 --> 00:10:05.270
No, I don't want to see anyone today.

00:10:05.270 --> 00:10:06.700
Please refuse.

00:10:06.700 --> 00:10:07.810
Certainly.

00:10:07.810 --> 00:10:09.170
I will tell Lord Fersen as such.

00:10:10.170 --> 00:10:11.110
Fersen?

00:10:11.740 --> 00:10:12.840
Fersen has come?!

00:10:20.050 --> 00:10:22.220
I'll see him for just a short while then.

00:10:22.220 --> 00:10:23.810
Please show him to my salon.

00:10:23.810 --> 00:10:24.720
Certainly.

00:10:28.290 --> 00:10:30.330
Where is the Queen?!

00:10:30.330 --> 00:10:33.230
Indeed! I've been waiting for 4 hours already!

00:10:33.230 --> 00:10:37.870
My gifts will rot if I have to wait any longer!

00:10:37.870 --> 00:10:40.100
Hurry up and let us see the Queen!

00:10:41.270 --> 00:10:44.740
The Queen will appear
as soon as she is feeling well.

00:10:44.740 --> 00:10:46.800
Please be patient and wait a little longer.

00:10:53.630 --> 00:10:55.880
Oh, Duke de Guéméné...

00:10:58.120 --> 00:10:59.260
Grand Chamberlain.

00:10:59.260 --> 00:11:02.790
I have brought a distinguished guest
from abroad to see Queen Antoinette.

00:11:02.790 --> 00:11:04.390
Let her know immediately!

00:11:04.730 --> 00:11:10.460
Well, I'm afraid the Queen is feeling unwell
suddenly, so the audience is delayed.

00:11:10.460 --> 00:11:13.520
I was just explaining as such, so...

00:11:13.890 --> 00:11:15.320
Forget the foolish excuses.

00:11:15.320 --> 00:11:17.780
Let her know now! Now!

00:11:17.780 --> 00:11:18.640
Understand?!

00:11:18.640 --> 00:11:21.050
As I just mentioned, the Queen is currently...

00:11:21.050 --> 00:11:25.700
Are you refusing to let her know my,
Duke de Guéméné's request?!

00:11:25.700 --> 00:11:28.580
No, that is certainly not my intention...

00:11:29.350 --> 00:11:30.590
I've heard enough.

00:11:30.590 --> 00:11:32.120
Tell this to the Queen.

00:11:32.120 --> 00:11:36.230
Before you is Marquis Brahe, a special
emissary from the Kingdom of Denmark.

00:11:36.230 --> 00:11:40.300
If today's refusal for an audience
should develop into a diplomatic crisis,

00:11:40.300 --> 00:11:43.300
it will be Queen Marie Antoinette's fault!

00:11:43.300 --> 00:11:46.030
W-Well, that's...

00:11:49.370 --> 00:11:51.780
Everyone, carve this into your hearts!

00:11:51.780 --> 00:11:55.410
It seems the new Queen will have an
audience with a poor Swedish noble,

00:11:55.410 --> 00:11:58.610
but won't give us,
distinguished nobles an audience!

00:11:59.150 --> 00:12:01.620
Come, Marquis Brahe, let us leave here!

00:12:04.790 --> 00:12:05.760
<i>Oscar...</i>

00:12:12.600 --> 00:12:13.560
Step aside.

00:12:14.100 --> 00:12:14.960
Now!

00:12:17.100 --> 00:12:18.240
Please go ahead.

00:12:18.240 --> 00:12:21.110
There is more than enough room for you to pass.

00:12:21.110 --> 00:12:23.640
You've only been promoted to Regiment
Commander of the Royal Guards.

00:12:23.640 --> 00:12:25.010
Do not get cocky!

00:12:29.810 --> 00:12:32.010
<i>That Swedish noble de Guéméné mentioned...</i>

00:12:32.950 --> 00:12:37.960
<i>Does that mean... Lady Antoinette has neglected
the scheduled audience in favor of seeing Fersen?</i>

00:12:37.960 --> 00:12:39.270
<i>How could she...!</i>

00:12:49.620 --> 00:12:52.300
My, what a pleasant breeze.

00:12:52.300 --> 00:12:55.580
Fersen, even the wind is welcoming you.

00:12:56.410 --> 00:12:57.580
Lady Antoinette.

00:12:59.640 --> 00:13:02.010
I should take my leave now.

00:13:02.710 --> 00:13:05.920
It troubles me that I should
take up so much of your time.

00:13:05.920 --> 00:13:09.180
If I come here too often,
I'll keep you from your official duties.

00:13:09.650 --> 00:13:11.150
What are you saying, Fersen?

00:13:11.690 --> 00:13:15.560
Just speaking to you eases my heart.

00:13:15.560 --> 00:13:16.760
You mustn't feel troubled.

00:13:16.760 --> 00:13:18.660
Please stay as long as you like.

00:13:18.660 --> 00:13:19.660
But...

00:13:19.660 --> 00:13:21.070
Lady Antoinette,

00:13:21.070 --> 00:13:22.820
it's time for the concert.

00:13:23.370 --> 00:13:25.150
Please cancel the concert.

00:13:25.740 --> 00:13:27.110
Lady Antoinette!

00:13:27.110 --> 00:13:30.500
Say, Fersen, why don't we take
a walk outside? Come!

00:13:31.780 --> 00:13:33.040
<i>This is wrong...</i>

00:13:33.040 --> 00:13:35.210
<i>She mustn't cancel the concert like that.</i>

00:13:35.210 --> 00:13:37.250
<i>But how could this be...</i>

00:13:37.250 --> 00:13:39.950
<i>Just being by Lady Antoinette's side...</i>

00:13:39.950 --> 00:13:41.980
<i>...and seeing her beauty, I...</i>

00:13:42.520 --> 00:13:44.220
<i>I can't say anything!</i>

00:13:45.560 --> 00:13:47.090
What is it, Fersen?

00:13:47.090 --> 00:13:48.480
Come, let's go together.

00:13:48.930 --> 00:13:50.100
Y-Yes.

00:13:52.930 --> 00:13:54.470
Let's visit the Great Fountain today.

00:13:54.470 --> 00:13:56.480
The fountain is truly magnificent.

00:14:07.950 --> 00:14:13.370
If we let this continue, something terrible
will happen to Lady Antoinette!

00:14:13.370 --> 00:14:17.090
The ducal families hold enormous power,
only second to that of the royal family.

00:14:17.090 --> 00:14:22.000
She has neglected her social obligations with them and has even skipped several concerts already.

00:14:22.760 --> 00:14:23.960
Not only that,

00:14:23.960 --> 00:14:27.430
she surrounds herself with young,
easy-going people who are of low lineage.

00:14:27.430 --> 00:14:28.840
See, have a look.

00:14:39.110 --> 00:14:44.950
Even I'm bothered by her excessive display
of friendship with that man, Fersen.

00:14:46.820 --> 00:14:50.530
You're overthinking it, Countess Noailles.

00:14:50.530 --> 00:14:52.760
Oh, no, Count Mercy!

00:14:52.760 --> 00:14:55.760
You need to stop thinking of this so lightly!

00:14:55.760 --> 00:14:58.030
It may have been permissible
when she was the Dauphine,

00:14:58.030 --> 00:15:01.400
but it's a different story, now that she's Queen!

00:15:22.270 --> 00:15:24.230
Oh, you are...!

00:15:27.290 --> 00:15:28.150
Oscar!

00:15:28.590 --> 00:15:31.360
Fersen, I came here to warn you.

00:15:31.900 --> 00:15:33.130
I see.

00:15:33.130 --> 00:15:35.170
I can pretty much guess what it's about.

00:15:35.170 --> 00:15:36.260
Please sit down.

00:15:40.440 --> 00:15:42.870
If you already have an idea,
it'll be easier for me to tell you.

00:15:42.870 --> 00:15:46.800
Fersen, leave France immediately
and return to Sweden.

00:15:59.460 --> 00:16:01.620
It's about Lady Marie Antoinette, isn't it?

00:16:02.630 --> 00:16:05.730
Is someone spreading ill rumors?

00:16:05.730 --> 00:16:06.900
Not yet.

00:16:06.900 --> 00:16:09.450
Or if they are, it hasn't reached my ears yet.

00:16:10.100 --> 00:16:11.280
However,

00:16:11.280 --> 00:16:13.660
a few people have already noticed.

00:16:14.210 --> 00:16:15.700
I was somewhat aware.

00:16:16.510 --> 00:16:23.290
Lady Antoinette finds me a little... too interesting and treats me too kindly.

00:16:23.850 --> 00:16:26.120
It was permissible before,

00:16:26.120 --> 00:16:29.840
as she was the Dauphine who comparatively,
is allowed more freedom.

00:16:29.840 --> 00:16:31.010
But it's different now!

00:16:31.760 --> 00:16:34.060
She is Her Majesty, the Queen of France!

00:16:41.310 --> 00:16:45.210
Fersen, it's best you return to your
country and stay there for a while.

00:16:45.210 --> 00:16:49.980
Thinking back, it's unpredictable what kinds of
danger might come upon you in the future.

00:16:53.720 --> 00:16:54.840
I understand, Oscar.

00:16:55.350 --> 00:16:56.820
That was my eventual plan anyway.

00:16:57.890 --> 00:17:00.720
I'll do as you say for now,
until the court forgets me.

00:17:01.290 --> 00:17:02.220
But...

00:17:03.030 --> 00:17:06.090
But... Lady Antoinette is too beautiful...

00:17:06.700 --> 00:17:08.290
She's too beautiful.

00:17:13.770 --> 00:17:15.440
That's all I came to say.

00:17:15.440 --> 00:17:17.540
Thank you for listening.

00:17:17.540 --> 00:17:18.640
Farewell, Fersen.

00:17:18.640 --> 00:17:19.630
Wait, Oscar.

00:17:20.640 --> 00:17:22.640
Don't you... ever feel lonely?

00:17:24.550 --> 00:17:26.880
Dressed in that outfit,
even though you are a woman...

00:17:27.420 --> 00:17:30.490
Do you plan to spend your youth without
ever knowing the joys of being a woman?

00:17:33.120 --> 00:17:39.300
<i>From the moment I was born, I was raised as a man to follow in my father's, General Jarjayes' footsteps.</i>

00:17:39.300 --> 00:17:43.530
<i>I've never felt lonely and I am
happy with how things are now.</i>

00:17:50.440 --> 00:17:52.530
Oscar, let's meet again someday.

00:17:53.080 --> 00:17:54.340
We will, won't we?

00:17:59.780 --> 00:18:02.020
<i>This is all for Lady Antoinette's sake,</i>

00:18:02.020 --> 00:18:04.720
<i>and ultimately for our France.</i>

00:18:05.620 --> 00:18:07.090
<i>Forgive me, Fersen.</i>

00:18:15.270 --> 00:18:16.200
What's happening?

00:18:17.170 --> 00:18:21.160
Some child stole money from the Duke's carriage.

00:18:21.670 --> 00:18:22.500
A child?

00:18:35.490 --> 00:18:36.650
Duke de Guéméné!

00:18:37.390 --> 00:18:39.150
Please, Your Grace!

00:18:39.760 --> 00:18:41.490
Please, Your Grace!

00:18:41.490 --> 00:18:43.830
He's just a child who didn't know any better!

00:18:43.830 --> 00:18:45.220
Please forgive him!

00:18:45.560 --> 00:18:47.220
Oscar, that girl is...

00:18:48.370 --> 00:18:51.900
It's that girl, Rosalie, who tried
to sell herself to me the other day.

00:18:52.270 --> 00:18:54.160
Do you know this child?

00:18:54.610 --> 00:18:57.200
Yes, his name is Pierre and
he lives next door to me.

00:18:57.740 --> 00:19:00.570
He hasn't eaten anything for 2 days, so...

00:19:01.680 --> 00:19:03.750
Please have mercy!

00:19:03.750 --> 00:19:05.870
Please, I beg you, Your merciful Grace!

00:19:06.450 --> 00:19:07.580
Please!

00:19:14.860 --> 00:19:15.890
That's enough.

00:19:15.890 --> 00:19:16.670
Get lost.

00:19:17.490 --> 00:19:18.590
Your Grace!

00:19:20.700 --> 00:19:21.860
Thank you so much!

00:19:22.900 --> 00:19:26.200
Pierre, don't ever steal again, okay?

00:19:26.200 --> 00:19:27.970
Now, hurry on home.

00:19:27.970 --> 00:19:28.850
Okay!

00:19:51.530 --> 00:19:52.960
Pierre!

00:19:52.960 --> 00:19:54.790
Pierre! Pierre!

00:19:55.300 --> 00:19:56.730
Pierre! Pierre!

00:19:59.170 --> 00:20:01.100
Pierre!

00:20:12.440 --> 00:20:14.180
This is unforgivable!

00:20:14.180 --> 00:20:15.270
De Guéméné!

00:20:15.620 --> 00:20:16.290
Wait!

00:20:16.290 --> 00:20:16.980
Oscar!

00:20:17.760 --> 00:20:19.020
Wait, Oscar!

00:20:19.020 --> 00:20:19.790
Think of who he is!

00:20:19.790 --> 00:20:20.520
Let go of me!

00:20:20.520 --> 00:20:21.390
Let go of me, André!

00:20:21.390 --> 00:20:24.190
He's a member of a ducal family
that even the King can't touch!

00:20:24.190 --> 00:20:26.290
He's more than you can handle!

00:20:26.290 --> 00:20:27.230
Let go of me!

00:20:27.230 --> 00:20:28.300
Get out of my way!

00:20:28.300 --> 00:20:29.200
Move, André!

00:20:29.200 --> 00:20:30.100
Calm down!

00:20:30.100 --> 00:20:31.200
Calm down, Oscar!

00:20:36.750 --> 00:20:37.700
Come on!

00:20:38.440 --> 00:20:39.630
Hurry up and move the carriage!

00:21:01.930 --> 00:21:03.110
How...

00:21:03.110 --> 00:21:05.460
How could such a heinous act be allowed?!

00:21:06.070 --> 00:21:07.910
To Hell with the nobility!

00:21:07.910 --> 00:21:09.530
To Hell with the Duke!

00:21:21.350 --> 00:21:22.820
<i>That same night,</i>

00:21:23.520 --> 00:21:26.050
<i>Hans Axel von Fersen...</i>

00:21:26.050 --> 00:21:29.620
<i>...had left France and began
traveling back to Sweden.</i>

00:21:31.350 --> 00:21:34.940
<i>He would have to wait 4 long years...</i>

00:21:34.940 --> 00:21:39.460
<i>...before he'd be able to set
foot on French soil again.</i>

00:21:49.850 --> 00:21:51.110
I see...

00:21:51.620 --> 00:21:53.700
How rather... sudden...

00:21:56.620 --> 00:21:58.250
<i>What's wrong with me?</i>

00:21:58.820 --> 00:22:01.120
<i>It's as though there's a hole in my heart.</i>

00:22:01.790 --> 00:22:04.510
<i>Is this what loneliness feels like?</i>

00:22:05.560 --> 00:22:06.590
<i>Fersen...</i>

00:22:07.100 --> 00:22:09.090
<i>Why did you leave without saying a word to me?</i>

00:22:12.540 --> 00:22:13.180
<i>Fersen!</i>

00:22:14.240 --> 00:22:15.140
<i>Fersen!</i>

00:22:16.970 --> 00:22:18.270
<i>Fersen!</i>

00:22:20.380 --> 00:22:23.680
<i>Starting today, I'm all alone again.</i>

00:22:24.750 --> 00:22:26.610
<i>What am I to do, Fersen?</i>

00:22:27.890 --> 00:22:28.990
<i>Fersen!</i>

00:22:28.200 --> 00:22:32.870
To be continued

